      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What it checks\n1   name: matches the folder name\n2   name + description are present\n3   frontmatter opens and closes with ---\n4   references to skills that no longer exist\n\nProven against tests/ (skills broken on purpose).",
